WEBVTT

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:22.140
-I haven't seen this much money in a while.
-You're something else!

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.390
You sure this is okay?

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:24.600
It's nothing.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.980
Either way, I've got no use for it anymore.

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:31.490
So listen up, the man has a scar and one eye...

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:40.620
BLADE OF THE IMMORTAL

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.080
One, two, three

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.080
Undead tree

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:49.840
What truth

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.590
I'll come true

00:00:55.380 --> 00:01:00.770
Wow, wow, wow

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:04.520
I see that bright light

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:11.320
This is all I have

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:15.820
What did you say？
I know

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:19.950
Why do you say？

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:25.620
Hone the blade lie around

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:32.710
Survive of vision
Death and pleasure are my future

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:36.880
I got lost
I was lost

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:40.430
Survive of vision

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:43.720
Unfinished heaven

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:47.480
Now fight to claim your wounds

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:51.770
Don't know why
Don't know why

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:56.030
Survive of vision

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:08.750
We've come a long way.

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:12.090
And we're only a short walk away from Uenohara,

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:15.260
but I bet we wouldn't be able to
take a break there, huh?

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:17.090
Of course not.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:20.470
We ain't stopping until we
get four towns down to Konishi.

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:21.970
You must be joking.

00:02:24.060 --> 00:02:27.310
It really is painful to see up close.

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:30.600
Someone getting so frantic over a girl, that is.

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:34.980
That's what I hate about you.

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:36.780
It's as if I'm looking in a mirror.

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:38.700
You don't shut up.

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:43.330
You bastards...

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:46.660
Hold it right there!

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:59.550
Sorry for the wait, Mr. Manji.

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:02.300
You'll have to forgive me.

00:03:02.390 --> 00:03:05.260
We finally meet again, and this is how I greet you?

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:08.140
But at this point, anything goes

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:10.140
when it comes to the two of us.

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:15.440
Whether it's cutting off an arm,
or blaming others for your failures, or whatever.

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:18.900
What are you playing at?

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:22.200
I understand... Really, I do!

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.620
I was the same way.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:27.910
It really feels like it could just
reattach while it's warm.

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.790
It won't, you idiot.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:34.000
Although, Uenohara is just a hop skip and a jump...

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:39.420
If you could somehow
get it to a doctor, there's a chance...

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:41.300
Not that I'm going to let you.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:46.810
I feel like I've seen your face somewhere.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:48.390
Could be.

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:51.270
But this is the first time we've met.

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:53.850
That so? Then step aside.

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:55.150
Hey, silver hair.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:58.780
Were you the one who hired them?

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:00.610
They were 8 ryo per sword.

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:03.740
I've still only paid them half. And?

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:05.280
Then I'll wait for you.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:09.080
Hurry and go pay that remaining half.

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:14.290
The dead have no use for money. Am I wrong?

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.210
What are you talking about?

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:22.590
My business is with that slumped man
whose face has gone pale.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:24.590
Mr. Manji, tell him--

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.430
You talk too much, Shira.

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:33.560
You finally caught a stroke of good luck with this setup...

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:35.900
But now you're back to square one.

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:39.820
What are you? That's...

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:43.570
So-- So you're telling me

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:46.490
I can cut your neck, and your bowels...

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:48.740
Does this mean I can do whatever I want to you

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.410
and you'll have to live through it all?!

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.960
Do you see now, Magatsu? He's this kind of guy.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:57.000
Yeah. There's no doubt left in my mind.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.960
He's the one who killed Ren.

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.300
Roger that. Well,

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:02.970
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:03.880
Yeah.

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:06.010
Hey, Manji!

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:07.930
Don't start preparing to leave!

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:09.810
Quiet, fool!

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:13.230
I've got no business with a loafer like you!

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.270
Listen here...

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:19.150
Moments ago,

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:22.230
I cut your hand off from behind you.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:25.570
That doesn't anger you in the slightest?!

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:27.910
You worthless scum!

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:31.830
-Your opponent today is me!
-Move!

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:40.630
Magatsu?

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:43.380
You were part of the Itto-ryu, weren't you?

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:45.760
Shut your mouth.

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:49.090
Well, he won't get me with it twice.

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:52.060
That sure is one strange right arm.

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:53.930
It was no dagger.

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:55.350
Some kind of spear?

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:57.730
No, not quite, Magatsu.

00:05:57.810 --> 00:05:59.270
That's...

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.110
What in the...?

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:08.160
It's his own...?!

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:12.280
Mr. Manji...

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:17.370
It's up to you who you send as a substitute,

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:19.880
but at the very least, my right arm wasn't taken

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:23.210
by such a tepid little child.

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:25.550
I'm feeling a little sad over here.

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:30.180
I've figured out why your hair changed the way it did.

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:34.010
I'll bet it was quite the task,
shaving it down as much as you did.

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:37.020
I blacked out countless times.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:40.150
And every time I woke up, I asked myself,

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:43.480
"Why in the world am I doing such a thing?"

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:46.030
Well, that question, along with the pain,

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:50.610
both utterly disappeared the moment I saw your face.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:54.200
Plus, when I tried using this, I realized

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.950
it hurts like crazy.

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:59.120
Me, the one using it.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:02.290
I thought it would have gone numb long ago,

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:03.790
but I was naive.

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:07.340
-Has this guy lost it?
-Since I'm in such pain when I stab you...

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:10.090
No, if we go by what Rin said,

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:11.390
he's completely sane.

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:14.760
-This is normal for him. However...
-...how about you two show some guts too?

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:19.270
Well, I can't rightly leave this to someone else,

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:24.230
after seeing the sincerity you've demonstrated,
right, Shira?

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:37.580
What?

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:58.350
This is the silver haired guy's...

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:08.320
It's you. Don't scare me like that.

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:12.150
Sir Taito Magatsu is frightened?

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:13.660
Idiot.

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:16.120
Well, that's unimportant.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:19.410
It's gone just as I predicted.

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:24.080
It was just a bit over half a month ago
when I lopped off his hand.

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:27.960
He isn't used to swinging a sword around with one hand.

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:30.710
If he were accustomed to his
new center of gravity,

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:34.130
he wouldn't have rolled so far like he did.

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:36.140
On top of that, we're in these mountains.

00:08:36.220 --> 00:08:38.350
This must be a struggle for him.

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:40.890
And you've got your favorite home-field advantage here.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:42.390
What's this?

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:45.230
I thought you'd made your decision
to fight him yourself.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.610
You stupid?

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:49.650
Why do you think I brought you along?

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:52.740
It seemed like the only way to move things along.

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:55.240
All I've done is ready a battleground for you two.

00:08:57.280 --> 00:09:01.370
It's unbecoming to go into a frenzy
taking revenge for a girl,

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:05.120
but a man who chases after a girl,
avoiding all the fights he can

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:08.290
might be just as unbecoming.

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:11.590
Well, why don't we pay our last respects to each other,

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:13.920
as fellow travelers and unbecoming men?

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:16.130
Give it your all.

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:17.640
You know...

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:21.850
you can't just filter everyone into archetypes
as you see fit, like some wise man.

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:25.350
Whatever.

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:28.690
I'll take your words to heart.

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:31.530
Keep your wits about you.

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:32.440
Right.

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:38.450
Now...

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.000
You guys are still here?

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:57.090
-Did we get him?
-Don't let your guard down.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:58.470
Stab like you mean it.

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:09.810
Idiot. What if we actually kill him?

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:12.230
It's fine, he won't die.

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:13.360
I think...

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:17.110
We couldn't help it!

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:20.990
How else do you stop a guy who can
reattach his own arm after it's cut off?

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:22.870
How should we know what to do?

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:23.830
Hey!

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:28.420
I won't forgive this.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:30.960
You've pushed me over the limit.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:35.170
I'll kill you all.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:36.550
We're sorry!

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:45.390
Okay, then hurry and beat it. Shira won't be coming back.

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:46.680
Then, you'll forgive us?

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:49.390
Idiots! You think I'll let you off for free?

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:52.520
Once you've forked over all the money Shira gave you,
you can get lost.

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:55.780
This is all of it.

00:10:57.570 --> 00:10:58.700
You sure about that?

00:10:58.780 --> 00:10:59.780
Yes.

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.320
Ain't this a little short?

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:23.930
What? What are you doing here?

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:25.970
What happened to Manji?

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:27.430
He's not coming, numbskull.

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:31.270
Your opponent is me.

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:33.150
Today's my day.

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:39.490
It was Magatsu, or something, right?

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:42.740
Self-taught swordplay with an odd sword like that.

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.870
Just who are you? Don't tell me, Itto-ryu?

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:47.490
And if I am?

00:11:47.580 --> 00:11:50.710
Now hold on just a minute, you dummy.

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:53.380
Is this really time you can afford to be wasting?

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:55.290
Just go home.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:59.050
Your leader is in Kaga getting into some real trouble.

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:03.180
Oops, was I not supposed to tell anyone just yet?

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:05.510
Hey, what was that you just said?

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:09.310
If you want to know,
why don't you head to Kaga?

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:11.940
You can just leave me for Manji to deal with.

00:12:21.900 --> 00:12:24.320
You little...

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:33.750
Hey, isn't your body weight a bit low?

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:37.880
It sure is nice to resent someone.

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:42.800
How should I put it?
There's this sense of fulfillment that I just can't describe.

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:45.590
For a punk like me with nothing to protect,

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:48.180
it's one of the few reasons I get up in the morning.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:51.640
You think I'll allow a kid like you to get in the way of that?

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:56.310
Seems your wound has opened up
from all the horsing around.

00:12:56.400 --> 00:13:00.150
You idiot. You reap what you sow!

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:30.010
Damn it.

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:35.480
Where is he?

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:48.280
Just as I thought. He's not giving chase.

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:50.160
He must have realized

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:53.290
that he won't be able to fight in the mountains.

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:56.410
That's fine. He can stay in the shed all he likes.

00:13:56.500 --> 00:14:00.170
With my smaller body, I've still got a lot left in me.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:02.460
Just watch me. I'll wipe the smug look off his--

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:18.270
Kid...

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:31.780
You stupid kid!

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:34.950
Die already! Come on!

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:47.260
You...

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:50.680
Is this the sword you used to cut into Ren's chest?

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:54.430
I'm sure it was soft and easy to cut through,

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:56.470
the body of a woman.

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:16.040
Bring it on!

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:18.080
For all that you've done,

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:22.130
you'll have to try harder to kill me.

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:25.170
You hear me, "big brother Tai"?

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:31.260
So you did realize it.

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:33.350
Well, when you share so much with me...

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:36.350
So she was yours, was she?

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:39.850
A bit childlike, but a great woman, nonetheless.

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.690
Cut the crap.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:45.650
A guy like you doesn't remember
the face of each person he kills.

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:49.400
But this one I remember.

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:50.990
As you might guess,

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:55.410
it's a little daunting to enter the pleasure district
with a body like mine.

00:15:55.490 --> 00:15:59.870
In other words, she was the last woman I embraced.

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:04.330
Uh-oh, don't snap on me!
You'd be barking up the wrong tree.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:08.300
The job of a prostitute is to spread her legs.

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:11.380
As long as the money is there, it doesn't matter who.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.050
Is that all you have to say?

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:17.850
Nope, there's more.

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:20.480
I've got something I want to ask you.

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:24.520
Do you know the best way to sleep with a woman?

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:26.480
I'll tell you...

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.650
You have to pierce their heart the moment you release.

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:32.400
When a person is stabbed in a vital point,

00:16:32.490 --> 00:16:35.120
the body loses all its strength momentarily,

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:39.450
after which, all the muscles tighten up.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:41.370
The muscles down there too.

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:45.170
You're a guy, I know you understand.

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:48.800
You know that indescribable feeling.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:52.010
But I'm not just some cutthroat, you know?

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:55.220
It's not like I do that every time I sleep with a woman.

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:59.720
If I recall, your girl was probably the fifth one
to go that way.

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:02.060
That's why I remember her.

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:10.320
I was in the middle of my story--

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:14.320
Oh, boy, he snapped.

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:21.870
You've got to stay calm in times like these,

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:23.370
"big brother Tai."

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:26.580
Goodbye,

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:29.670
and also thank you, Taito Magatsu.

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:32.510
Hey now, don't make such a sad face.

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:34.800
You're about to go meet your little cutie.

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:38.180
I really am sorry.

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:43.180
For keeping the two of you lovebirds apart
for even an instant.

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:44.520
Even so--

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:45.770
Hey, Shira.

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:51.070
Have you noticed how it's cooler here than on the road?

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:53.650
What nonsense are you--?

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:55.450
You don't get it?

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:57.240
Then let me show you right now.

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:02.620
Hey, you!

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:05.080
Are you copying Manji?!

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:06.290
Let go of me!

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:30.270
This was a good decision.

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:33.530
How does it feel?

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:35.440
Having your life held in another's hands,

00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:37.740
unable to lift even a finger?

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:39.320
Well?

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:40.910
How does it feel?

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:46.000
If you're a villain, then beg for your life like one.

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:48.670
Scream it out so Ren can hear you from the afterlife.

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.040
I won't beg for my life.

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:53.880
I won't jump on my own either.

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:56.340
Don't take me lightly, you dunce.

00:18:57.510 --> 00:19:00.760
My way of doing things is to struggle and struggle
my way to the top,

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:03.810
just like this, and be the winner in the end.

00:19:03.890 --> 00:19:09.440
Can you put on an act as unsightly as that,
Mister Itto-ryu?

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:11.190
Cut it.

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:12.610
It hurts to say,

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:16.780
but I don't have the strength left to pull myself back up.

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:19.780
But if you leave me with my hand,

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:22.700
I'll crawl back up after I fall down

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:25.870
and someday come for your head.

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:28.870
Now that would be just terrifying, right?!

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:31.670
If you're scared, go ahead and sever this hand too.

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:36.050
Manji took the right hand,

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:38.090
and you'll take the left.

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:40.470
It'll be a grudge to the second power.

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:43.220
I've never experienced loathing two people so badly

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:45.640
that I want to slaughter them both!

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:47.930
I wonder how it'll feel!

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:54.150
I can't help being overcome with excitement!

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:10.540
So, what happened?

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:13.920
I assume you took ample revenge for your woman.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:15.040
Yeah.

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:22.590
This marks the end of our sordid travels together.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:25.550
Mr. Manji, I've changed my plans.

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:28.770
I'll head to Kaga too as soon as my wounds close.

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:32.600
That guy said some strange things about my leader.

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:36.650
Leader? I thought you left the Itto-ryu.

00:20:36.730 --> 00:20:39.320
Well, yes, that is true...

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:42.320
But as a person...

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:46.490
What's that mean? "As a person"?

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:48.700
You can laugh all you like,

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:51.120
but if I find that man in Kaga,

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:53.330
and you and I happen to cross paths again,

00:20:53.410 --> 00:20:58.040
we'll probably be on opposite sides.
Remember that.

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:03.130
A parting gift.

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:07.600
Use it to heal your wounds quicker
and join up with your allies.

00:21:07.680 --> 00:21:08.970
You...

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:09.970
You see,

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:13.640
I picked it up off of those bald guys
while you were fighting.

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:17.440
While I was risking my life, you were extorting people?

00:21:17.520 --> 00:21:20.610
Which is why I'm giving you half of it!

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:23.570
And it's not like I acquired it without any effort.

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:29.370
Though, thanks to this money,

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:32.000
it should only be four days to Kaga by palanquin.

00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:40.250
Rin...don't bite the dust out there.

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:15.910
Am I...

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:18.040
alive?

00:23:50.590 --> 00:23:54.800
ACT ELEVEN - FALL FROST
